:: TunnelEntrance
<h2 class="story-title">The Night of Decision</h2>

The bride adorns herself completely—kohl for her eyes, sindur for her forehead, pearls in her hair, every piece of jewelry glittering against her skin.

She stands before the tunnel entrance. The darkness stretches before her like the throat of some ancient beast.

Her heart is pounding. She takes a breath.

**How should she enter?**

[[Rush forward eagerly, overcome with longing|TunnelCollapse]]
[[Move slowly and carefully, testing each step|TunnelTransition]]

